Flash instruction (using U-Boot web-based recovery):

  - Configure PC with static IP 192.168.1.xxx(2-254)/24.
  - Connect PC with one of RJ45 ports, press the reset button, power up the board and keep button pressed for around 6-7 seconds, until LEDs start flashing.
  - Open your browser and enter 192.168.1.1, if your board is e2600ac c1, select "sysupgrade" image and click the upgrade button.
  - Open your browser and enter 192.168.1.1, if your board is e2600ac c2, select "ubi" image and click the upgrade button.


Firmware OpenWrt Install:
  - E2600AC C1/C2, select "xxx-sysupgrade.bin"


