==== Specification =====

  * 256 MB of RAM (DDR3)
  * 16 MB of FLASH (SPI NOR)
  * 128 MB of FLASH (NAND)
  * 2T2R 2.4 GHz
  * 2T2R 5L/H GHz
  * 3x 10/100/1000 Mbps Ethernet (one port with PoE support)
  * 1x miniPCIe slot
  * 11x LED (10 driven by GPIO)
  * 1x 2-pos switch

